    "page.conn.p.opposites-on-the-zodiac-wheel-six": "Opposites on the zodiac wheel — six signs apart, facing each other directly across the circle. Ideal for reflecting blindspots and learning from a radically different point of view.",
    "page.conn.h3.values-trine": "Values Trine",
    "page.conn.p.shared-value-both-animals-belong-to": "Shared value — both animals belong to the same Values Triangle, so you often speak the same language when it comes to life's priorities.",
    "page.conn.h3.same-as-me": "Same-As-Me",
    "page.conn.p.the-same-totem-animal-at-the": "The same totem animal at the same pillar — or the same animal in a different \"ring\" born 12, 24, or 36 years apart. Same guides; wonderfully different people.",
    "page.conn.connections-join-form.label.i-agree-to-list-my-display": "I agree to list my display name, four totem animals, optional area, intro, and optional email in this public directory after review.",
    "page.conn.connections-join-form.p.page-build-20260883": "Page build 20260883",
    "page.conn.section-label.five-connection-modes.2": "Ngaahi founga fehokotaki ʻe nima",
    "page.conn.h2.how-matching-works.2": "Founga ʻo e Fakatauhoa",
    "page.conn.p.each-person-has-four-totem-animals.2": "ʻOku ʻi ai ha fanga monumanu totem ʻe fa ʻa e tokotaha taki taha — Laumalie, ʻAtamai, Loto mo e Sino. ʻOku mau fakafehoanaki ʻa e pou tatau ʻi he vahaʻa ʻo ha toko ua pea maʻu ha founga fehokotakiʻanga ʻe nima.",
    "page.conn.connections-join-form.label.i-agree-to-list-my-display.2": "ʻOku ou loto fiemalie ke hiki hoku hingoa ʻoku fakaʻaliʻali mai, fanga monumanu totem ʻe fa, feituʻu fili, intro, mo e ʻimeili fili ʻi he tohi tuʻasila ko ʻeni ʻa e kakai hili hono vakaiʻi.",
    "page.conn.connections-join-form.p.page-build-20260883.2": "Page build 20260883",
    "page.connType.rainbow.section-label.connection-type": "Faʻahinga Fehokotakiʻanga",
    "page.connType.rainbow.h1.rainbow": "ʻUmata",
    "page.connType.rainbow.p.yin-and-yang-companions-each-one": "Ko e hoa ʻo e Yin mo e Yang — ʻoku na takitaha ʻomi ʻa e lanu totonu ʻo e monumanu ʻe taha ʻo hange ha prism, ko ia ai ʻa e foʻi lea ko e ʻRainbow.ʻ Ko ha hoa hahamolofia ʻoku mahuʻinga ke fakamahuʻingaʻi ʻi he taimi kotoa pe ʻoku ke fetaulaki ai mo ia.",
    "page.connType.rainbow.p.totem-connections": "<a href=\"connections.html?v=20260807\">← Totem Connections</a>",
    "page.connType.rainbow.p.yin-and-yang-companions-each-one.2": "Ngaahi hoa Yin mo Yang — ʻOku na takitaha ʻomi ʻa e lanu totonu ʻo e monumanu ʻe taha ʻo hange ha prism, ko ia ai ʻa e foʻi lea ko e \"ʻUmata\" — ʻi he faʻahinga fehokotaki ko ʻeni, ʻoku ke fesiofaki moʻoni ai! Ko ha hoa hahamolofia ia, pea ʻoku totonu ke fakamahuʻingaʻi ia ʻi he taimi kotoa pe te ke fetaulaki ai mo ia! ʻOku fie maʻu ha ngaue lahi kimuʻa pea mateuteu ʻa e tokolahi ʻo e kakai ki he faʻahinga fehokotakiʻanga ko ʻeni — he ko hono moʻoni, ʻe fakaʻaliʻali kotoa hoʻo ngaahi lanu moʻoni ʻi he taimi kotoa, ko ia ʻe lelei ange ke ke fakapapauʻi ʻoku fakangingila mo ngingila kotoa ho ngaahi tafaʻaki!",
    "page.connType.rainbow.h3.other-connection-types": "Ngaahi faʻahinga fehokotakiʻanga kehe",
    "page.connType.rainbow.li.shadow": "<a href=\"connection-shadow.html?v=20260807\">Shadow</a>",
    "page.connType.rainbow.li.mirror-opposite": "<a href=\"connection-mirror-opposite.html?v=20260807\">Sioʻata Fehangahangai</a>",
    "page.connType.rainbow.li.values-trine": "<a href=\"connection-values-trine.html?v=20260807\">Values Trine</a>",
    "page.connType.rainbow.li.same-as-me": "<a href=\"connection-same-as-me.html?v=20260807\">Tatau pe mo au</a>",
    "page.connType.rainbow.h2.find-rainbow-matches": "Kumi ʻa e Rainbow Matches",
    "page.connType.rainbow.p.calculate-your-four-totem-animals-then": "Fikaʻi hoʻo fanga monumanu totem ʻe fa, pea vakai ki he tohi tuʻasila ʻo e opt-in ki he kakai ʻoku nau vahevahe ʻa e faʻahinga fehokotakiʻanga ko ʻeni mo koe.",
    "page.connType.rainbow.btn.totem-connections-directory": "Totem Connections Tohi Tuʻasila",
    "page.connType.rainbow.btn.totem-animals-calculator": "Totem Animals Calculator",
