    "page.connType.mirror-opposite.h2.find-mirror-opposite-matches": "Kumi ʻa e ngaahi hoa ʻo e sioʻata fehangahangai",
    "page.connType.mirror-opposite.p.calculate-your-four-totem-animals-then": "Fikaʻi hoʻo fanga monumanu totem ʻe fa, pea vakai ki he tohi tuʻasila ʻo e opt-in ki he kakai ʻoku nau vahevahe ʻa e faʻahinga fehokotakiʻanga ko ʻeni mo koe.",
    "page.connType.mirror-opposite.btn.totem-connections-directory": "Totem Connections Tohi Tuʻasila",
    "page.connType.mirror-opposite.btn.totem-animals-calculator": "Totem Animals Calculator",
    "page.connType.values-trine.section-label.connection-type": "Faʻahinga Fehokotakiʻanga",
    "page.connType.values-trine.h1.values-trine": "Ngaahi tuʻunga ʻulungaanga mahuʻinga Trine",
    "page.connType.values-trine.p.shared-value-both-animals-belong-to": "Vahevahe ʻo e mahuʻinga — ʻoku fakatou kau ʻa e fanga monumanu ki he Tapatolu Mahuʻinga tatau, ko ia ʻoku ke faʻa lea ʻaki ʻa e lea tatau ʻi he taimi ʻoku hoko mai ai ki he ngaahi meʻa ʻoku fakamuʻomuʻa ʻi he moʻui.",
    "page.connType.values-trine.p.totem-connections": "<a href=\"connections.html?v=20260807\">← Totem Connections</a>",
    "page.connType.values-trine.p.shared-value-both-animals-belong-to.2": "Shared value — ʻoku fakatou kau ʻa e ongo fakafoʻituitui ki he Values Triangle tatau: Power & Prestige, Security & Stability, Inspiration & Idealism, pe Peace & Harmony. Ko e ngaahi fetuʻutaki ko ʻeni ko ha kakai ʻoku nau mahuʻingaʻia tatau mo e ngaahi meʻa ʻoku ke fakamuʻomuʻa. ʻOku nau vakai ki he moʻui ʻi he founga tatau pe — ʻo tatau ai pe pe ko e feinga ke maʻu ʻa e malohi mo e taukei ʻi ha ngaue maʻuʻanga moʻui, pe ko e fekumi ki he melino mo ha toʻonga moʻui nonga. Ko e kakai ʻeni ʻoku tatataha ke ke fakamatalaʻi koe, koeʻuhi he kuo nau ʻosi fenapasi mo koe, ʻo ʻaonga ai ʻeni ki ha faʻahinga va fetuʻutaki pe: pisinisi pe taimi maloloo, famili pe kaungameʻa. Lele lelei :)",
    "page.connType.values-trine.h3.other-connection-types": "Ngaahi faʻahinga fehokotakiʻanga kehe",
    "page.connType.values-trine.li.rainbow": "<a href=\"connection-rainbow.html?v=20260807\">ʻUmata</a>",
