    "page.terms.permitted-use.li.use-the-totem-astrology-name-or": "Vakayagataka na yaca se batibati Totem Astrology me baleta e dua na veiqaravi, app, se buli bisinisi ena so tale na vanua",
    "page.terms.permitted-use.li.scrape-or-mirror-the-site-in": "Vakatadrai se vakatovolea na siti ena sala e vakadukadukalitaka na dauvola se na kena iwasewase",
    "page.terms.permitted-use.p.for-licensing-media-use-or-partnership": "Me baleta na lawa batabata, vakayagataki ni itukutuku, se taro ni veimaliwai, yalo vinaka <a href=\"contact.php\">veitaratara mai</a>.",
    "page.terms.disclaimer.h2.readings-disclaimer": "Valea kei na Vakatakila",
    "page.terms.disclaimer.p.totem-astrology-is-offered-as-a": "E vakarautaki tiko o Totem Astrology me yaco me iwalewale ni kilaka vakasama kei na vakadinadinataki ni veika e yaco ena veiwekani — sega ni me vaka ni vakadewa ni gauna ni sotavi, veivakadeitaki ni bula, veivakadeitaki ni lawa, se veivakadeitaki ni ilavo. Na veivakaro kei na iwalewale ni site e me baleta na vuli kei na nanuma. O dau tomani na veika o digitaka ena nomu bula.",
    "page.terms.registration-roadmap.h2.registration-roadmap": "Iwalewale ni Vakaleweni",
    "page.terms.registration-roadmap.p.if-you-are-travis-or-advising": "Kevaka o iko o Travis (se vakarautaka na nona vakadidike) ka vakarautaka na ivola vakadonui, o koya oqo na vei yaga levu me veivosakitaki vata kei na dua na daunivakatovolei ni lewa se na USPTO:",
