    "page.terms.registration-roadmap.li.educational-pages-how-it-works-values": "<strong>i veiqaravi ni vuli</strong> — Na sala e cakava kina, Iveli ni Triangles, Yin & Yang, kei eso tale.",
    "page.terms.registration-roadmap.li.original-artwork-totem-animal-images-zod": "<strong>Vakatakilakila vakadodonu</strong> — iyaloyala ni manumanu totem, waqavuka ni zodiac, ivolakerekere ni lima na veika vakasivi",
    "page.terms.registration-roadmap.li.software-calculator-and-connections-sour": "<strong>Software</strong> — kalkiletera kei na kodo ni veika me baleta na veitarogi (vakadodonutaki ni volitaki ke vakacurumi na isau vakabisinisi)",
