    "page.terms.registration-roadmap.li.confirm-consistent-spelling-totem-astrol": "Dodinaka na volai vakavinaka: <em>Totem Astrology</em> kei na <em>TotemAstrology.com</em>",
    "page.terms.registration-roadmap.li.choose-nice-classes-with-your-attorney": "Digitaka na kalasi vinaka kei nomu lotu ni lawa (me vaka na veivosaki/veivosaki, yabaki ni vuli, ivola ena internet)",
    "page.terms.registration-roadmap.li.document-first-use-in-commerce-site": "Na itekitekivu ni kena vakayagataki na ivola ena bisinisi — vakavoutaki ni sito, volai na veivakadinadina, veisiga ni vakamacalataki vei nodra qarava na lewe ni vanua",
    "page.terms.registration-roadmap.li.keep-copies-of-key-versions-of": "Taqomaka na ivoli ni veisau bibi ni ivakarau kei na veiqaravi me ivakatakilakila ni itukutuku",
    "page.terms.registration-roadmap.li.after-registration-update-to-only-on": "Oti na rejisiterai, vakavoutaki na ™ me ® ga ena imatai ni ivakaraitaki era a rejisiteri dina",
