    "page.calc.h3.how-it-works": "Na sala e cakava kina",
    "page.calc.p.your-birth-year-month-day-and": "Na nomu ibulibuli na <strong>yabaki, vula, siga, kei na aua</strong> e vakaraitaka e dua na manumanu totem me daulomani — o nomu iTaukei, lewa ni vakasama, tuvatuva ni yalo, kei na iTuvatuva ni yagodra.",
    "page.calc.p.before-calculating-we-convert-your-birth": "Qai na muri ni vakadidike, eda na vakauqeta na gauna o dauvakabauta kina me i<strong>Nepal Time</strong> — e dua na veisau e yavutaki ena itovo ni Four Pillars kei na tikina vakasouli ni vanua a yacovi kina na tereni nei Buddha. <a href=\"nepal-time.html\">Cava e Nepal Time?</a>",
    "page.calc.p.after-your-totem-pole-appears-click": "Mai muri ni totem pole ni yabaki, <strong>kiliki e dua na ivakarau manumanu</strong> me dolava e dua na i vakasala bibi me baleta na totem qori, na kena iwalewale, kei na kena i tovo Yin se Yang.",
    "page.calc.h4.the-bigger-picture": "Na ilavelave levu",
    "page.calc.p.totem-astrology-maps-your-four-guides": "Totem Astrology e vakarautaka vei iko na nomu vula vatu ena <strong>Na Time ni Nepal</strong>, na <strong>Lima na Loma ni Ka</strong>, <strong>Yin &amp; Yang</strong>, <strong>Triangles ni i Tuvatuva</strong>, kei na <strong>iYau Vakayalo</strong> — vata oqo e bulia e dua na vosa me kilai kina iko kei era tale eso.",
